SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
---------------------
This license covers the SOFTWARE in this repository only: the notebook,
the `cmap_demo/` package, and the synthetic sample transcript authored here.

It does NOT cover the dataset in `data/1_cleaned_data.csv`. That corpus was
webscraped from the IEEE History Center's Engineering and Technology History
Wiki and carries its own separate restriction: no part of the data may be
quoted for publication without the written permission of the Director of the
IEEE History Center. See SAMPLE_DATA.md for the full notice and provenance.
Nothing in this license grants any right in that data.

Portions of `cmap_demo/viz.py` are recycled from the CMAP Visualization
Toolkit (BSD 3-Clause, Computational Ethnography Lab) and carry per-function
attribution headers naming their source and release tag.

